MINUTES

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:16.650
OF TESTIMONY PER SIDE.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.340
SO PLEASE DIVIDE IT UP, AND THIS
HEARING

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.200
