00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.890
THE CONSENT CALENDAR CONSISTS

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:40.260
OF THE FOLLOWING SJ R 18.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.880
SENATOR PADILLA.

00:00:41.909 --> 00:00:43.020
TIJUANA RIVER.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:47.010
