UM, SEISMIC SAFETY COMPLIANCE
WITH

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.550
AMENDMENTS ITEM NUMBER SEVEN,

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:57.100
AB 1859 ASSEMBLY MEMBER ALANIS

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.530
