ADULTERATED MEANS A TOBACCO
PRODUCT THAT REQUIRES

01:40:20.650 --> 01:40:23.080
FDA APPROVAL AND HAS NOT
RECEIVED IT.

01:40:23.920 --> 01:40:27.939
UM, PROBLEM IS ADULTERATED IS
THE WRONG STANDARD

01:40:27.939 --> 01:40:31.810
TO USE BECAUSE THE FDA ITSELF
