01:40:49.450 --> 01:40:52.570
IT MAY CONTINUE TO BE LEGALLY
SOLD IN THE US

01:40:52.570 --> 01:40:55.630
UNTIL THE FDA DECIDES ON ITS
APPLICATION.

01:40:55.750 --> 01:40:58.780
NOW, THE FDA REPORTS THAT IT
HAS ACTED

01:40:58.780 --> 01:41:02.810
ON OVER 99% OF THE WAIT FOR
