01:41:02.810 --> 01:41:06.040
MILLION APPLICATIONS THAT IT
HAS RECEIVED.

01:41:06.340 --> 01:41:08.260
BUT HERE'S THE PROBLEM THERE ARE

01:41:08.260 --> 01:41:10.540
