01:41:14.500 --> 01:41:18.130
ALL OF THESE PRODUCTS ARE
ADULTERATED NOT BECAUSE

01:41:18.130 --> 01:41:19.750
THERE'S SOMETHING WRONG WITH
THE PRODUCT,

01:41:19.750 --> 01:41:21.310
NOT BECAUSE THEY'RE BAD ACTORS,

01:41:21.310 --> 01:41:24.340
BUT SIMPLY BECAUSE THE FDA
HASN'T

01:41:24.340 --> 01:41:26.170
APPROVED THEIR APPLICATION YET.

01:41:26.740 --> 01:41:29.470
THE FDA'S RECOGNIZED THAT THESE
MANUFACTURERS HAVE

01:41:29.470 --> 01:41:32.170
DONE EVERYTHING ASKED OF THEM
UNDER THE LAW,

01:41:32.170 --> 01:41:35.050
AND IS THEREFORE USING ITS
ENFORCEMENT DISCRETION

01:41:35.050 --> 01:41:37.479
TO ALLOW THESE ADULTERATED
PRODUCTS

01:41:37.479 --> 01:41:39.970
TO CONTINUE TO BE LEGALLY SOLD
UNTIL

01:41:39.970 --> 01:41:42.550
THE FDA DECIDES ON THEIR
APPLICATION.

01:41:42.580 --> 01:41:44.710
THAT'S WHY IT'S THE WRONG
STANDARD

01:41:44.710 --> 01:41:45.880
TO USE IN THE BILL.

01:41:45.880 --> 01:41:47.860
ADULTERATED IS NOT THE STANDARD

01:41:47.860 --> 01:41:49.960
THE FDA USES FOR THESE PRODUCTS.

01:41:49.960 --> 01:41:52.150
IN FACT, USING THIS STANDARD IN

01:41:52.150 --> 01:41:53.590
THE BILL WILL PUT CALIFORNIA IN

01:41:53.590 --> 01:41:55.960
DIRECT CONFLICT WITH HOW THE FDA

01:41:55.960 --> 01:41:57.310
IS REGULATING THESE PRODUCTS.

