01:42:16.210 --> 01:42:17.680
ISSUE BEFORE THE BILL LEAVES
THE SENATE.

01:42:17.680 --> 01:42:18.340
THANK YOU.

01:42:18.970 --> 01:42:20.710
WELL, IT'S NOT ADULTERATED.

01:42:20.710 --> 01:42:21.910
THAT'S THE PROBLEM THEN.

