THANK YOU, MR.

01:42:37.780 --> 01:42:38.350
CHAIRMAN.

01:42:38.350 --> 01:42:40.360
BECAUSE WHY DO YOU SAY THEY'RE
ADULTERATED?

01:42:40.360 --> 01:42:41.560
WHAT DO WE PUT IN THEM?

01:42:42.400 --> 01:42:44.229
I THINK THAT'S A COMMON
MISCONCEPTION.

01:42:44.229 --> 01:42:45.939
SO ADULTERATED JUST MEANS THAT

01:42:45.939 --> 01:42:47.710
THEY HAVE TO BE APPROVED

01:42:47.710 --> 01:42:50.229
BY THE FDA AND THEY HAVE NOT
RECEIVED THAT APPROVAL.

01:42:50.229 --> 01:42:51.430
TO YOUR QUESTION, SIR, THAT'S
NOT.

01:42:51.430 --> 01:42:53.710
THE COMMON UNDERSTANDING OF
ADULTERATED BECAUSE.

01:42:53.710 --> 01:42:54.280
CORRECT.

01:42:54.280 --> 01:42:58.360
WE DEAL WITH THAT IN A VARIETY
OF PLACES AND SPOTS

01:42:58.360 --> 01:43:00.790
IN WHAT WE DO IN THIS COMMITTEE
AND ELSEWHERE.

01:43:00.790 --> 01:43:02.890
YES, ULCERATED MEANS YOU PUT
SOMETHING

01:43:02.890 --> 01:43:04.960
IN IT THAT'S NOT NATURALLY
OCCURRING.

01:43:04.960 --> 01:43:05.620
CORRECT.

01:43:05.620 --> 01:43:07.960
BUT IN THIS CASE, IT JUST MEANS
IT IS

01:43:07.960 --> 01:43:10.000
NOT RECEIVED THE REQUIRED
FEDERAL

01:43:10.000 --> 01:43:12.370
APPROVAL AND THEREFORE IT IS
ADULTERATED

01:43:12.370 --> 01:43:14.350
UNDER THE TOBACCO CONTROL ACT.

01:43:14.350 --> 01:43:15.520
THE FEDERAL LAW.

01:43:16.030 --> 01:43:18.700
UM, BUT AS I MENTIONED,

01:43:18.970 --> 01:43:22.060
THE FDA IS USING ITS ENFORCEMENT

01:43:22.060 --> 01:43:23.650
