01:59:24.510 --> 01:59:26.730
INFANTS WITH A LIFE SAVING
PROTECTION

01:59:26.730 --> 01:59:28.200
THEY NEED FROM HUMAN MILK.

01:59:28.200 --> 01:59:31.230
MY SON RONAN, PICTURED HERE, WAS
BORN AT 28 WEEKS

01:59:31.230 --> 01:59:34.230
GESTATION WEIGHING JUST £1, TWO
OUNCES.

01:59:34.560 --> 01:59:36.450
HE WAS IMMEDIATELY TAKEN TO
THE NICU

01:59:36.450 --> 01:59:39.030
AND BEGAN BEGAN FIGHTING FOR
HIS LIFE.

01:59:39.030 --> 01:59:41.460
I FOCUSED ALL MY EFFORTS INTO
ANYTHING

01:59:41.460 --> 01:59:42.270
I COULD DO TO HELP HIM,

01:59:42.270 --> 01:59:43.410
WHICH AT THE TIME WAS PUMPING

01:59:43.410 --> 01:59:45.300
BREAST MILK AFTER SUFFERING

01:59:45.300 --> 01:59:46.980
LIFE THREATENING PREGNANCY
COMPLICATIONS.

01:59:46.980 --> 01:59:47.640
MYSELF.

01:59:47.640 --> 01:59:50.280
MY BODY UNFORTUNATELY PRODUCED
LITTLE TO NONE.

01:59:50.430 --> 01:59:52.050
FEEDING AND GROWING IS A HUGE

01:59:52.050 --> 01:59:53.400
CHALLENGE AS A MICRO PREEMIES

01:59:53.400 --> 01:59:56.460
UNDERDEVELOPED GI SYSTEM IS
EXTREMELY FRAGILE.

01:59:56.460 --> 01:59:58.620
