02:00:00.090 --> 02:00:02.490
WHICH RONAN GOT AS SOON AS HE
WAS ABLE.

02:00:02.490 --> 02:00:05.040
CLINICALLY, I KNOW THE
IMPORTANCE OF HUMAN MILK.

02:00:05.040 --> 02:00:06.450
I WAS THANKFUL FOR THIS CRUCIAL

02:00:06.450 --> 02:00:07.800
BUT LIMITED RESOURCE.

02:00:08.280 --> 02:00:10.650
EVENTUALLY, HE WAS TRANSITIONED
TO FORMULA.

02:00:10.650 --> 02:00:12.930
WE FACED TYPICAL UPS AND DOWNS
OF THE NICU,

02:00:12.930 --> 02:00:14.130
AND DESPITE PROGRESS,

02:00:14.130 --> 02:00:16.200
AFTER SEVEN WEEKS INTO OUR
JOURNEY,

02:00:16.200 --> 02:00:17.610
RONAN TOOK A TURN.

02:00:17.610 --> 02:00:19.560
HE WAS DIAGNOSED WITH
NECROTIZING

02:00:19.560 --> 02:00:21.840
ENTEROCOLITIS OR NECK AND NECK,

02:00:22.080 --> 02:00:24.690
A DEVASTATING INTESTINAL
INFLAMMATION.

02:00:24.690 --> 02:00:27.090
HE HAD TWO SURGERIES WITH SOME
OF THE BEST SURGEONS

02:00:27.090 --> 02:00:29.760
IN THE FIELD TO ATTEMPT TO SAVE
HIS LIFE,

02:00:29.760 --> 02:00:31.920
BUT SADLY DEVELOPED A FULLY
NECROTIC BOWEL,

02:00:31.920 --> 02:00:33.240
LEADING TO SEPSIS.

02:00:33.690 --> 02:00:35.490
ON DECEMBER 20TH, 2020,

02:00:35.490 --> 02:00:36.930
RONAN TOOK HIS LAST BREATH IN.

02:00:36.930 --> 02:00:37.830
MY ARMS.

02:00:37.830 --> 02:00:40.290
NECK COMES ON FAST AND
AGGRESSIVELY.

02:00:40.290 --> 02:00:42.150
I WENT FROM DREAMING OF THE DAY
I WOULD BRING

02:00:42.150 --> 02:00:44.310
RONAN HOME TO PLANNING HIS
FUNERAL.

02:00:44.310 --> 02:00:46.770
THE SINGLE GREATEST PREDICTOR
AGAINST

02:00:46.770 --> 02:00:47.970
NECK IS MOTHER'S MILK,

02:00:47.970 --> 02:00:49.140
AND WHEN NOT AVAILABLE,

02:00:49.140 --> 02:00:51.600
DONOR BREAST MILK IS THE NEXT
BEST OPTION.

02:00:51.600 --> 02:00:53.880
STUDIES HAVE SHOWN THAT THIS
CAN DECREASE

02:00:53.880 --> 02:00:57.120
NECK THE RISK OF NECK BY AS MUCH
AS 50%.

02:00:57.210 --> 02:00:59.610
AFTER RONAN'S DEATH, I CONNECTED
WITH THE NEXT

02:00:59.610 --> 02:01:02.580
SOCIETY A NONPROFIT FOUNDED BY
ANOTHER MOTHER

02:01:02.580 --> 02:01:04.980
WHO LOST A CHILD FROM THIS
DEVASTATING DISEASE

02:01:04.980 --> 02:01:07.350
AND FOCUSED ON BUILDING A WORLD
WITHOUT IT.

02:01:07.800 --> 02:01:09.720
THIS IS HOW I PARENT MY SON.

02:01:09.960 --> 02:01:12.090
I HAVE READ NUMEROUS RESEARCH
ARTICLES

02:01:12.090 --> 02:01:13.500
PUBLISHED ABOUT THIS DISEASE.

02:01:13.500 --> 02:01:15.420
I HAVE LIVED THROUGH THE
DEVASTATION

02:01:15.420 --> 02:01:17.910
AND DONOR BREAST MILK MAKES A
DIFFERENCE.

02:01:17.910 --> 02:01:20.760
ALL BABIES IN THE NICU NEED
ACCESS TO BREAST MILK,

02:01:20.760 --> 02:01:23.850
REGARDLESS OF LOCATION OR
SOCIOECONOMIC STATUS,

02:01:23.850 --> 02:01:26.130
AND MOTHER'S MILK IS NOT ALWAYS
AN OPTION.

02:01:26.130 --> 02:01:30.060
LIKE IN MY CASE, AB 3059 WILL
PROTECT FAMILIES

02:01:30.060 --> 02:01:31.650
FROM SAYING GOODBYE TO THEIR
BABIES.

02:01:31.650 --> 02:01:33.000
I BEG YOU TO MAKE SURE THAT

02:01:33.000 --> 02:01:34.680
ALL FAMILIES IN CALIFORNIA

02:01:34.680 --> 02:01:37.380
HAVE ACCESS TO THIS VITALLY
IMPORTANT RESOURCE,

02:01:37.380 --> 02:01:38.910
AND THAT YOU JOIN ME IN TAKING

02:01:38.910 --> 02:01:40.230
A STEP TOWARD BUILDING

02:01:40.230 --> 02:01:42.420
A WORLD WITHOUT THIS HORRENDOUS
DISEASE.

02:01:43.310 --> 02:01:44.420
WE ARE SO SORRY.

02:01:44.420 --> 02:01:45.950
THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

