TRIPLE

02:23:36.010 --> 02:23:37.330
NEGATIVE BREAST CANCER.

02:23:37.360 --> 02:23:39.400
A MORE AGGRESSIVE AND
CHALLENGING TO TREAT

02:23:39.400 --> 02:23:41.560
SUBTYPE OF CANCER THAT
DISPROPORTIONATELY

02:23:41.560 --> 02:23:43.629
