02:23:43.629 --> 02:23:45.640
THE RATE OF OTHER RACIAL ETHNIC
GROUPS,

02:23:45.640 --> 02:23:47.680
HIGHLIGHTING THE URGENCY TO
ELIMINATE

02:23:47.680 --> 02:23:49.810
DEHP FROM IV BAGS AND TUBING.

02:23:49.840 --> 02:23:51.820
TO MITIGATE THIS DISPARITY AND
IMPROVE

02:23:51.820 --> 02:23:54.430
HEALTH OUTCOMES FOR ALL
CALIFORNIANS.

