02:24:12.580 --> 02:24:14.350
THE DEMAND FOR FDA APPROVED,

02:24:14.350 --> 02:24:17.290
DEHP FREE IV BAGS IN CALIFORNIA.

02:24:17.500 --> 02:24:19.060
AS A REGISTERED NURSE WITH OVER

02:24:19.060 --> 02:24:20.560
26 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE,

02:24:20.560 --> 02:24:23.050
