MISCARRIAGE

02:26:01.890 --> 02:26:03.720
AND GESTATIONAL DIABETES.

02:26:03.810 --> 02:26:06.510
DEHP HAS NO PLACE IN IV BAGS
AND TUBING,

02:26:06.510 --> 02:26:08.490
