02:26:09.810 --> 02:26:12.420
CITY OF HOPE AND KAISER
PERMANENTE HAVE ALREADY

02:26:12.420 --> 02:26:14.340
PHASED OUT THIS HARMFUL
ADDITIVE.

02:26:14.370 --> 02:26:17.910
IN 2002, THE FDA ISSUED A PUBLIC
HEALTH NOTIFICATION

02:26:17.910 --> 02:26:19.709
URGING HEALTH CARE PROVIDERS TO

02:26:19.709 --> 02:26:22.050
REDUCE THE EXPOSURE OF
VULNERABLE POPULATIONS

02:26:22.050 --> 02:26:24.570
TO MEDICAL DEVICES CONTAINING
DEHP.

02:26:24.810 --> 02:26:26.940
HOWEVER, THE FDA DID NOT BAN ITS

02:26:26.940 --> 02:26:28.709
