02:26:28.709 --> 02:26:30.150
REQUIRE THEM TO LABEL WHETHER

02:26:30.150 --> 02:26:32.340
THEIR DEVICES CONTAIN DEHP.

02:26:32.370 --> 02:26:33.810
GIVEN THE WELL-ESTABLISHED

02:26:33.810 --> 02:26:35.129
HEALTH CONCERNS ASSOCIATED

02:26:35.129 --> 02:26:37.290
WITH EXPOSURE TO THIS TOXIC
CHEMICAL,

02:26:37.290 --> 02:26:39.150
I URGE YOU TO SUPPORT THIS
COMMON SENSE,

02:26:39.150 --> 02:26:41.490
HEALTH PROTECTIVE LEGISLATION
AND ASK FOR YOUR VOTE.

