DEPARTMENT OF PUBLIC HEALTH.

02:30:35.950 --> 02:30:38.950
UM, ALSO KNOWN AS CDPH, FOUND
THAT WOMEN OF COLOR,

02:30:38.950 --> 02:30:40.420
IN PARTICULAR BLACK WOMEN,

02:30:40.420 --> 02:30:42.970
DIE OF PREGNANCY RELATED
COMPLICATIONS AT MUCH

02:30:42.970 --> 02:30:45.310
HIGHER RATES THAN WHITE WOMEN
IN CALIFORNIA.

02:30:45.310 --> 02:30:49.030
THIS DISPARITY EXISTS ACROSS ALL
INCOME LEVELS.

02:30:49.030 --> 02:30:50.890
NOW, TO ADDRESS THIS, THE
CALIFORNIA

02:30:50.890 --> 02:30:51.820
STATE LEGISLATURE

02:30:51.820 --> 02:30:54.670
LEGISLATURE PASSED THE ACT IN
2019,

02:30:54.670 --> 02:30:57.610
WHICH REQUIRES HOSPITALS,
ALTERNATIVE BIRTH CENTERS,

02:30:57.610 --> 02:30:59.230
AND PRIMARY CARE CLINICS,

02:30:59.230 --> 02:31:00.640
WHICH ARE THE FACILITIES COVERED

02:31:00.640 --> 02:31:02.290
UNDER THE ACT TO CONDUCT

02:31:02.290 --> 02:31:05.500
EVIDENCE BASED IMPLICIT BIAS
TRAINING FOR ALL HEALTH

02:31:05.500 --> 02:31:07.300
PROFESSIONALS WHO PROVIDE CARE

02:31:07.300 --> 02:31:08.920
DURING A PERSON'S PREGNANCY,

02:31:08.920 --> 02:31:11.440
CHILDBIRTH, AND IMMEDIATE
POSTPARTUM PERIOD.

02:31:11.620 --> 02:31:14.560
IN AUGUST 2021, THE DEPARTMENT

02:31:14.560 --> 02:31:17.050
OF JUSTICE, ALSO KNOWN AS DOJ,

02:31:17.050 --> 02:31:19.150
LAUNCHED AN INVESTIGATION TO
ASCERTAIN

02:31:19.150 --> 02:31:21.220
ASCERTAIN COMPLIANCE WITH THE
ACT.

02:31:21.220 --> 02:31:23.080
WHILE SOME FACILITIES WENT ABOVE

02:31:23.080 --> 02:31:25.240
AND BEYOND THE REQUIREMENTS OF
THE ACT,

02:31:25.240 --> 02:31:27.400
THERE IS STILL MORE WORK TO
BE DONE

02:31:27.400 --> 02:31:29.110
TO ENSURE FULL COMPLIANCE.

02:31:29.110 --> 02:31:31.480
DOJ'S INVESTIGATION REVEALED
THAT THERE

02:31:31.480 --> 02:31:33.879
IS A NEED FOR AN ENFORCEMENT
MECHANISM,

02:31:33.879 --> 02:31:35.800
PUBLIC TRANSPARENCY OF
COMPLIANCE,

02:31:35.800 --> 02:31:37.990
DATA FIRM COMPLIANCE DEADLINES,

02:31:37.990 --> 02:31:40.780
AND ADDITIONAL SPECIFIC
SPECIFICITY

02:31:40.780 --> 02:31:42.580
AND CLARITY SO THAT FACILITIES

02:31:42.580 --> 02:31:44.650
ARE BETTER EQUIPPED TO KNOW
WHICH

02:31:44.650 --> 02:31:46.030
PROVIDERS NEED TO BE TRAINED.

02:31:46.030 --> 02:31:49.000
AND AB 2319 ACCOMPLISHED THIS.

02:31:49.810 --> 02:31:51.790
I AM A MOTHER AND A GRANDMOTHER.

02:31:51.790 --> 02:31:53.170
I HAVE SISTERS, AUNTS,

02:31:53.170 --> 02:31:55.959
NIECES AND FRIENDS THAT LOOK
JUST LIKE ME.

02:31:55.959 --> 02:31:56.890
AS A BLACK WOMAN.

02:31:56.890 --> 02:31:59.350
THESE STATISTICS HIT WAY TOO
CLOSE TO HOME.

02:31:59.350 --> 02:32:01.660
THEY ACKNOWLEDGED THE SOBERING
REALITY OF BEING

02:32:01.660 --> 02:32:03.459
A PREGNANT WOMAN OF COLOR IN
THIS STATE,

02:32:03.459 --> 02:32:05.230
AND HIGHLIGHTS THE NEED TO
CORRECT

02:32:05.230 --> 02:32:07.629
THE COURSE WE'RE ON NOW WITH
ME TODAY.

02:32:07.629 --> 02:32:10.000
TO TESTIFY IN SUPPORT IS TIFFANY
MATTHEWS WITH

02:32:10.000 --> 02:32:13.240
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL'S OFFICE
AND KIM TYAGI.

02:32:14.940 --> 02:32:15.600
SAY IT AGAIN.

02:32:16.110 --> 02:32:16.530
KAI.

02:32:16.830 --> 02:32:17.550
SORRY.

02:32:17.790 --> 02:32:18.120
UM.

02:32:18.150 --> 02:32:22.050
A PROFESSIONAL AND COMMUNITY
DOULA WITH BLACK

02:32:22.050 --> 02:32:23.730
WOMEN FOR WELLNESS ACTION
PROJECT.

02:32:23.730 --> 02:32:26.820
TO SPEAK MORE ON THE IMPORTANCE
OF AB 2319,

02:32:26.820 --> 02:32:29.280
AND TO ANSWER ANY QUESTIONS THAT
YOU MAY HAVE.

02:32:29.459 --> 02:32:30.150
WELCOME.

02:32:30.150 --> 02:32:31.200
THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

02:32:31.200 --> 02:32:32.970
PLEASE IDENTIFY YOURSELVES FOR

02:32:32.970 --> 02:32:34.410
THE RECORD WHEN YOU BEGIN TO
SPEAK,

02:32:34.410 --> 02:32:37.620
AND I'LL LET YOU CHOOSE WHICH
WHO GOES FIRST.

02:32:37.620 --> 02:32:38.129
YES, MA'AM.

02:32:38.129 --> 02:32:39.270
LOOKS LIKE IT'S YOU.

02:32:39.540 --> 02:32:40.379
&GT;&GT; I'LL JUMP IN.

02:32:40.379 --> 02:32:40.920
THANK YOU.

02:32:40.920 --> 02:32:41.400
HI.

02:32:41.550 --> 02:32:44.640
UH, TIFFANY BROKAW, MY LAST NAME
RECENTLY CHANGED.

02:32:44.910 --> 02:32:47.129
UM, BUT ANYWAY, THANK YOU.

02:32:47.129 --> 02:32:47.970
THANK YOU.

02:32:48.570 --> 02:32:50.550
UM, GOOD AFTERNOON, CHAIR AND
MEMBERS.

02:32:50.670 --> 02:32:52.560
UM, TIFFANY BROKAW, DEPUTY
ATTORNEY

02:32:52.560 --> 02:32:53.970
GENERAL AND LEGISLATIVE

02:32:53.970 --> 02:32:56.940
ADVOCATE AT THE CALIFORNIA
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE.

02:32:56.940 --> 02:32:58.620
AND I'M HERE TODAY ON BEHALF OF

02:32:58.620 --> 02:33:00.000
ATTORNEY GENERAL ROB BONTA,

02:33:00.000 --> 02:33:03.930
WHO IS ONE OF THE PROUD
CO-SPONSORS OF THIS BILL,

02:33:03.930 --> 02:33:05.670
ALONG WITH BLACK WOMEN FOR
WELLNESS

02:33:05.670 --> 02:33:07.230
ACTION PRODUCT PROJECT,

02:33:07.230 --> 02:33:08.940
REPRODUCTIVE FREEDOM FOR ALL,

02:33:08.940 --> 02:33:10.980
WESTERN CENTER ON LAW AND
POVERTY,

02:33:10.980 --> 02:33:13.530
THE CALIFORNIA NURSE MIDWIVES
ASSOCIATION,

02:33:13.530 --> 02:33:15.300
AND BLACK WOMEN'S COLLECTIVE.

02:33:15.540 --> 02:33:16.980
WE'D LIKE TO THANK THE AUTHOR,

02:33:16.980 --> 02:33:18.600
ASSEMBLY MEMBER WILSON

02:33:18.600 --> 02:33:21.240
AND DOCTOR WEBER FOR THEIR
LEADERSHIP

02:33:21.240 --> 02:33:22.500
ON THIS AND THE REST

02:33:22.500 --> 02:33:24.750
OF THE CALIFORNIA LEGISLATIVE

02:33:24.750 --> 02:33:26.160
BLACK CAUCUS FOR MAKING

02:33:26.160 --> 02:33:28.230
THIS BILL A PRIORITY, AND

02:33:28.230 --> 02:33:29.610
THE WOMEN'S CAUCUS AS WELL.

02:33:30.090 --> 02:33:33.120
SO THE UNITED STATES HAS THE
HIGHEST MATERNAL

02:33:33.120 --> 02:33:35.070
MORTALITY RATE IN THE DEVELOPED
WORLD.

02:33:35.070 --> 02:33:37.350
AND IN CALIFORNIA, PEOPLE OF
COLOR,

02:33:37.350 --> 02:33:38.760
PARTICULARLY BLACK WOMEN,

02:33:38.760 --> 02:33:41.490
CONTINUE TO DIE AT 3 TO 4 TIMES

02:33:41.490 --> 02:33:42.840
THE RATE OF WHITE WOMEN.

02:33:44.129 --> 02:33:48.090
AB 2319 AIMS TO REDUCE THE
ALARMING

02:33:48.090 --> 02:33:49.800
AND DISPROPORTIONATE MATERNAL

02:33:49.800 --> 02:33:51.900
MORTALITY RATES BY ENSURING

02:33:51.900 --> 02:33:53.459
SUCCESSFUL IMPLEMENTATION

02:33:53.459 --> 02:33:56.129
OF THE CALIFORNIA DIGNITY IN
PREGNANCY

02:33:56.129 --> 02:33:57.360
AND CHILDBIRTH ACT,

02:33:57.360 --> 02:33:59.220
WHICH WAS AUTHORED BY THEN
SENATOR

02:33:59.220 --> 02:34:01.379
HOLLY MITCHELL IN 2019.

02:34:01.530 --> 02:34:03.330
SO THE ACT REQUIRES HEALTH

02:34:03.330 --> 02:34:05.010
CARE FACILITIES TO CONDUCT

02:34:05.010 --> 02:34:07.080
EVIDENCE BASED IMPLICIT BIAS

02:34:07.080 --> 02:34:08.580
TRAININGS FOR ALL HEALTH

02:34:08.580 --> 02:34:10.530
PROFESSIONALS WHO PROVIDE CARE

02:34:10.530 --> 02:34:12.300
DURING A PATIENT'S PREGNANCY,

02:34:12.300 --> 02:34:15.270
CHILDBIRTH, AND IMMEDIATE
POSTPARTUM PERIOD.

02:34:16.080 --> 02:34:18.690
SO IT'S ONE THING FOR A LAW TO
GET PASSED,

02:34:18.690 --> 02:34:21.240
BUT IT'S ANOTHER TO MAKE SURE
THAT IT'S IMPLEMENTED.

02:34:21.240 --> 02:34:25.170
SO IN AUGUST OF 2021, DOJ
LAUNCHED AN INVESTIGATION

02:34:25.170 --> 02:34:27.390
TO ASCERTAIN COMPLIANCE WITH
THE ACT.

02:34:27.390 --> 02:34:30.660
AND ONCE DOJ BEGAN ITS
INVESTIGATION,

02:34:30.660 --> 02:34:33.360
WHEREBY THEY SENT LETTERS TO
ALL COVERED

02:34:33.360 --> 02:34:35.940
FACILITIES TO SEE WHAT EFFORTS
WERE

02:34:35.940 --> 02:34:38.640
BEING MADE TO COMPLY WITH THE
ACT.

02:34:38.910 --> 02:34:39.270
UM.

02:34:40.170 --> 02:34:42.030
BASED ON INFORMATION THAT WAS
PROVIDED

02:34:42.030 --> 02:34:43.890
TO THEM BY RESPONDING
FACILITIES.

02:34:43.890 --> 02:34:48.720
THEY FOUND THAT ABOUT 17% OF
FACILITIES

02:34:48.720 --> 02:34:51.120
HAD BEGUN COMPLYING WITH THE
ACT,

02:34:51.120 --> 02:34:53.640
AND NOT ONE EMPLOYEE HAD BEEN
FULLY TRAINED,

02:34:53.640 --> 02:34:56.129
AND BY THE END OF THE
INVESTIGATION,

02:34:56.129 --> 02:34:59.250
ABOUT 81% OF PROVIDERS HAD BEEN
FULLY TRAINED.

02:34:59.250 --> 02:35:01.830
SO THE WHOLE GOAL OF THIS IS
TO JUST

02:35:01.830 --> 02:35:03.390
CLOSE THAT GAP AND MAKE SURE

02:35:03.390 --> 02:35:05.700
THAT 100% OF THE PROVIDERS
COVERED

02:35:05.700 --> 02:35:07.050
IN THE ACT ARE BEING TRAINED,

02:35:07.050 --> 02:35:09.030
BECAUSE THE GOAL HERE IS TO
REDUCE

02:35:09.030 --> 02:35:10.800
BIAS IN OUR HEALTH CARE SYSTEM.

02:35:10.920 --> 02:35:14.100
SO TO BETTER EQUIP HEALTH
FACILITIES TO COMPLY WITH

02:35:14.100 --> 02:35:16.590
THE ACT AND ADMINISTER THESE
REQUIRED

02:35:16.590 --> 02:35:18.120
ANTI-BIAS TRAININGS,

02:35:18.150 --> 02:35:21.900
AB 2319 WILL PROVIDE CLARITY
ON WHICH

02:35:21.930 --> 02:35:24.870
FACILITIES ARE MANDATED TO
ADMINISTER

02:35:24.870 --> 02:35:26.430
THESE TRAININGS AND WHICH
PROVIDERS

02:35:26.430 --> 02:35:27.510
NEED TO BE TRAINED.

02:35:27.720 --> 02:35:30.270
IT WILL ESTABLISH FIRM DEADLINES
BY WHICH TRAININGS

02:35:30.270 --> 02:35:33.270
MUST BE COMPLETED TO BETTER
GUIDE COMPLIANCE.

02:35:33.300 --> 02:35:37.440
IT WILL ALSO CONFER ENFORCEMENT
POWERS UPON THE DOJ,

02:35:37.440 --> 02:35:41.040
AND IT WILL AUTHORIZE THE DOJ
TO POST COMPLIANCE

02:35:41.040 --> 02:35:43.200
DATA ONLINE SO THAT THE PUBLIC

02:35:43.200 --> 02:35:45.900
CAN SEE WHICH FACILITIES DID
OR DID

02:35:45.900 --> 02:35:47.520
NOT ADMINISTER THESE TRAININGS.

02:35:47.520 --> 02:35:49.560
AND FOR THESE REASONS, WE
RESPECTFULLY

02:35:49.560 --> 02:35:50.520
ASK FOR YOUR VOTE.

02:35:50.970 --> 02:35:51.629
THANK YOU.

02:35:51.660 --> 02:35:52.680
NEXT, PLEASE.

02:35:55.550 --> 02:35:57.440
GREETINGS, SENATOR ROTH, AN
ESTEEMED

02:35:57.440 --> 02:35:58.760
HEALTH COMMITTEE MEMBERS.

02:35:58.760 --> 02:36:00.410
MY NAME IS CHRIS GEORGI.

02:36:00.410 --> 02:36:05.030
I'M A VETERAN DOULA OF 25 YEARS
OF NONSTOP PRACTICE,

02:36:05.030 --> 02:36:07.580
WHICH KIND OF MAKES ME A UNICORN
IN THIS FIELD.

02:36:07.700 --> 02:36:11.240
I TRAIN DOULAS IN THE COMMUNITY,
AND I'M A FOUNDER

02:36:11.240 --> 02:36:13.250
OF CHILDREN OF THE SUN DOULA
PROJECT,

02:36:13.250 --> 02:36:16.430
A NONPROFIT DEDICATED TO
INCREASING THE COMMUNITY

02:36:16.430 --> 02:36:19.370
BASED BIRTH SUPPORT WORKFORCE.

02:36:19.580 --> 02:36:24.230
I'VE SEEN LOTS OF CHANGES IN 25
YEARS OF BIRTH WORK.

02:36:24.230 --> 02:36:27.470
I'VE SEEN THE MODERNIZATION OF
MEDICAL FACILITIES.

02:36:27.470 --> 02:36:30.440
I'VE SEEN THE MEDICATIONS
OFFERED IN MEDICAL

02:36:30.440 --> 02:36:33.530
MANAGEMENT OF LABOR AND BIRTH
CHANGE.

02:36:33.530 --> 02:36:36.410
I'VE EVEN SEEN THE QUALITY OF
THE FOOD SERVED

02:36:36.410 --> 02:36:39.050
IN THE HOSPITAL CAFETERIAS
IMPROVE.

02:36:39.470 --> 02:36:42.770
THE ONE THING THAT HASN'T
CHANGED IS THE IMPACT

02:36:42.770 --> 02:36:45.709
OF BIAS ON MEDICALLY RESPONSIVE
CARE.

02:36:45.980 --> 02:36:47.660
BECAUSE I HAVE SERVED SO MANY

02:36:47.660 --> 02:36:48.980
OF THE FAMILIES REPRESENTING

02:36:48.980 --> 02:36:52.040
THE INCREDIBLY DIVERSE
POPULATION IN THIS REGION,

02:36:52.040 --> 02:36:55.100
I HAVE HAD A FRONT ROW SEAT AND
THE DIFFERENCES

02:36:55.100 --> 02:36:58.220
BETWEEN CARE OF BIPOC FAMILIES
AND WHITE

02:36:58.220 --> 02:37:01.220
PRESENTING FAMILIES WHEN BIAS
IS UNRECOGNIZED

02:37:01.220 --> 02:37:04.310
AND UNCHECKED ARE DEMORALIZING.

02:37:04.310 --> 02:37:07.070
LET ME SHARE A FEW BRIEF
STORIES.

02:37:08.400 --> 02:37:10.830
THERE WAS A BIRTH WITH A YOUNG
MOM

02:37:10.830 --> 02:37:14.160
AND DAD HAVING THEIR FIRST BABY,

02:37:14.400 --> 02:37:17.220
AND THEY WERE ATTENDING AN OB
WHO

02:37:17.220 --> 02:37:19.260
HAD QUITE SOME TIME IN THE
FIELD.

02:37:19.820 --> 02:37:22.250
AND HE MADE IT VERY CLEAR THAT
HE PREFERRED

02:37:22.250 --> 02:37:23.990
TO BE AT A DIFFERENT BIRTH.

02:37:24.390 --> 02:37:27.450
SO MUCH SO THAT WHEN THE SECOND

02:37:27.450 --> 02:37:28.980
BIRTH WAS PROGRESSING

02:37:28.980 --> 02:37:31.920
MORE QUICKLY THAN THE ONE THAT
HE WAS ATTENDING,

02:37:31.920 --> 02:37:35.970
HE LEFT IN THE MIDDLE OF THE
BIRTH WITH

02:37:35.970 --> 02:37:39.090
HIS RESIDENT'S HAND INSIDE OF
THE MOM,

02:37:39.090 --> 02:37:42.240
HOLDING AN INCISION THAT HE HAD

02:37:42.240 --> 02:37:44.400
CREATED TO RUSH HER THROUGH

02:37:44.400 --> 02:37:47.220
DELIVERING THE BABY AND NOT
FINISH SUTURING.

02:37:47.459 --> 02:37:48.840
THAT'S ONE STORY.

02:37:49.590 --> 02:37:53.040
ANOTHER COUPLE HAVING THEIR
SECOND BABY.

02:37:53.040 --> 02:37:55.200
PROFESSIONAL MIDDLE CLASS PEOPLE

02:37:55.200 --> 02:37:56.850
VERY EXCITED ON THIS OPPORTUNITY

02:37:56.850 --> 02:37:59.730
TO HAVE A BABY AND ONE OF THEIR
REGULAR SCANS.

02:37:59.730 --> 02:38:04.230
DURING THEIR CARE, IT WAS
DISCOVERED THAT MOM'S BODY

02:38:04.230 --> 02:38:07.290
MIGHT BE OPENING A LITTLE EARLY
FOR THIS BABY.

02:38:07.740 --> 02:38:09.690
THIS HAPPENS OFTEN, AND THERE IS

02:38:09.690 --> 02:38:12.390
A REGULAR COMMON PROCEDURE THAT

02:38:12.390 --> 02:38:14.220
HAPPENS TO HELP MOM'S BODY STAY

02:38:14.220 --> 02:38:16.320
CLOSED SO BABY CAN STAY INSIDE.

02:38:16.770 --> 02:38:18.420
SOMEHOW, DURING THIS PROCEDURE,

02:38:18.420 --> 02:38:20.250
THERE WAS A CATASTROPHIC ERROR,

02:38:20.580 --> 02:38:22.830
AND ONLY HALFWAY THROUGH THE
PREGNANCY,

02:38:22.860 --> 02:38:24.629
HER WATER BAG WAS RUPTURED.

02:38:26.260 --> 02:38:28.840
SHE WAS BROUGHT BACK TO HER
ROOM,

02:38:28.840 --> 02:38:30.879
LEFT IN THE HOSPITAL ROOM ALL

02:38:30.879 --> 02:38:33.730
NIGHT BY HERSELF WITH ONLY HER
HUSBAND,

02:38:33.730 --> 02:38:35.530
NO MONITORING, NO CARE.

02:38:35.530 --> 02:38:37.840
LEAKING FLUID, NOT EVEN KNOWING

02:38:37.870 --> 02:38:39.580
IF HER BABY WAS STILL ALIVE.

02:38:40.360 --> 02:38:41.860
THE NEXT MORNING.

02:38:42.450 --> 02:38:44.310
THEY ARE ON THE PHONE WITH ME

02:38:44.310 --> 02:38:45.870
AND THE NURSE THAT COMES IN.

02:38:45.900 --> 02:38:49.200
THE FIRST THING SHE SAYS IS
WE DON'T

02:38:49.200 --> 02:38:52.020
DO TERMINATIONS OF PREGNANCY
HERE.

02:38:52.770 --> 02:38:55.290
AND BASICALLY SAID, GO HOME.

02:38:56.129 --> 02:39:00.209
UM, IT TOOK A LOT OF ADVOCACY
TO GET SOME CARE.

02:39:00.240 --> 02:39:03.840
THE CARE FINALLY HAPPENED, BUT
AT THIS POINT THERE

02:39:03.840 --> 02:39:07.140
WAS AN INFECTION THAT OCCURRED
FROM THE PROCEDURE.

02:39:07.140 --> 02:39:08.490
AND TWO DAYS LATER,

02:39:08.490 --> 02:39:10.950
THEIR BABY WAS BORN AND PASSED
AWAY.

02:39:12.350 --> 02:39:16.940
THE LAST STORY A MOM MARRIED
HAVING

02:39:16.940 --> 02:39:19.580
A HISTORY OF SOME MISCARRIAGES

02:39:19.580 --> 02:39:21.770
WHICH IN HER OWN RESEARCH,

02:39:21.770 --> 02:39:23.629
SHE DISCOVERED WERE PREVENTABLE.

02:39:23.629 --> 02:39:27.470
HAD THERE BEEN PROACTIVE CARE
WHEN

02:39:27.470 --> 02:39:31.070
THE PREGNANCY THAT SHE WAS
EXPERIENCING,

02:39:31.550 --> 02:39:34.040
UM, GOT TO THE SECOND TRIMESTER,

02:39:34.040 --> 02:39:35.629
THE BABY PASSED AWAY.

02:39:35.990 --> 02:39:39.410
SHE REACHED OUT FOR CARE THAT
MADE SENSE

02:39:39.410 --> 02:39:41.690
FOR HER BODY TO HER PROVIDERS,

02:39:42.020 --> 02:39:43.970
UH, CHECKING MULTIPLE PROVIDERS,

02:39:43.970 --> 02:39:45.140
MULTIPLE FACILITIES.

02:39:45.140 --> 02:39:48.080
SHE REACHED OUT TO SUPPORT OF A
BIRTH PROFESSIONAL,

02:39:48.080 --> 02:39:50.870
AND I WENT WITH HER TO THESE
APPOINTMENTS

02:39:50.870 --> 02:39:53.450
WHERE MULTIPLE TIMES PEOPLE
CAME IN,

02:39:53.450 --> 02:39:54.980
NOT EVEN HAVING READ HER CHART.

02:39:54.980 --> 02:39:56.900
HEY, WHAT ARE YOU HERE FOR
TODAY?

02:39:56.930 --> 02:39:57.230
WHERE?

02:39:57.230 --> 02:39:58.700
SHE HAD TO SAY REPEATEDLY.

02:39:58.700 --> 02:39:59.990
MY BABY DIED.

02:40:00.629 --> 02:40:02.700
IT TOOK FIVE MONTHS.

02:40:03.459 --> 02:40:05.890
FIVE MONTHS OF CARRYING HER
DECEASED

02:40:05.890 --> 02:40:08.470
BABY INSIDE OF HER BODY TO
FINALLY

02:40:08.470 --> 02:40:10.870
GET CARE THAT COULD RESOLVE WHAT

02:40:10.870 --> 02:40:13.300
THEY CALL A MISSED MISCARRIAGE,

02:40:13.300 --> 02:40:16.360
SO THAT SHE COULD MOVE ON WITH
HER PHYSICAL HEALTH

02:40:16.360 --> 02:40:19.540
AND BEGIN THE PROCESS OF
GRIEVING HER BABY.

02:40:20.209 --> 02:40:22.879
AND EVEN AT THAT POINT OF CARE,

02:40:22.879 --> 02:40:25.520
ALL I DID WAS GO TO THE CAR
TO DRIVE

02:40:25.520 --> 02:40:27.230
HER HOME BECAUSE HER HUSBAND WAS

02:40:27.230 --> 02:40:28.820
HOME WITH THE OTHER CHILDREN.

02:40:28.940 --> 02:40:31.610
AND IN THE COURSE OF THAT, THEY
GAVE HER SOME SORT

02:40:31.610 --> 02:40:37.040
OF ANTIBIOTIC WHERE SHE HAD A
POOR REACTION TO IT.

02:40:37.370 --> 02:40:40.610
WHEN I CALLED AND ASKED SOME
QUESTIONS JUST ABOUT

02:40:40.610 --> 02:40:43.790
HOW SHE WAS DOING, THE NURSE
SNAPPED AT ME.

