03:19:00.610 --> 03:19:04.180
GENERATIVE ARTIFICIAL
INTELLIGENCE, OR GEN AI,

03:19:04.209 --> 03:19:06.640
FOR PATIENT COMMUNICATION TO
DISCLOSE

03:19:06.640 --> 03:19:08.530
THE TECHNOLOGY'S USAGE WHEN

03:19:08.530 --> 03:19:10.150
