03:19:13.570 --> 03:19:15.340
ARE TESTING THE USE OF GEN AI

03:19:15.370 --> 03:19:17.320
AS A TOOL TO ASSIST CLINICIANS

03:19:17.320 --> 03:19:19.060
WITH PATIENT COMMUNICATIONS.

03:19:19.060 --> 03:19:22.240
