CURRENTLY

03:19:22.240 --> 03:19:24.070
HAS A PILOT PROGRAM INTEGRATING

03:19:24.070 --> 03:19:26.770
GEN AI INTO MYCHART AS HEALTH

03:19:26.770 --> 03:19:28.840
CARE PROVIDERS DEPLOY GEN I.

03:19:28.870 --> 03:19:31.120
PATIENTS SHOULD BE AWARE OF WHO

03:19:31.150 --> 03:19:32.770
THEY ARE COMMUNICATING WITH TO

03:19:32.770 --> 03:19:34.209
MAINTAIN CONFIDENCE IN THE
HEALTH

03:19:34.209 --> 03:19:35.680
CARE THEY ARE RECEIVING.

03:19:35.920 --> 03:19:38.950
AB 3030 IS A GOOD GOVERNANCE
BILL SEEKING TO ENSURE

03:19:38.950 --> 03:19:41.560
THE ETHICAL USE OF GEN AI IN
HEALTH CARE.

03:19:41.560 --> 03:19:44.290
