03:19:55.870 --> 03:19:56.860
AB 3030.

03:19:56.860 --> 03:19:58.330
PROMOTES PATIENT AWARENESS.

03:19:58.330 --> 03:19:59.860
OF HOW THEIR HEALTH CARE IS
